       lijst, geen kaarten: het zijn regels bij een bestelling, geen producten. */
    moreH: 'The smaller lines',
    moreSub: 'Some add something to an order you are placing, others stand on their own. Each has its own page for the detail.',
    moreRows: [
      ['Extra catalog angle', `${euro(extraPhotoRate(1), 'en')} to ${euro(EXTRA_PHOTO_LADDER[EXTRA_PHOTO_LADDER.length - 1][2], 'en')} per photo, falling with your count`, 'A side, the inside, a second detail — added per product in the order form.', '/catalog'],
